      "sort_at": "2026-04-28T04:11:46.000Z",
      "text": "gnhf just became my first project that reached 1000 github stars! https://github.com/kunchenguid/gnhf\n\nreal stars accumulated over the past month, not bought for VCs lol. it’s just an open source tool that i made to make it dead simple for me to run @karpathy’s auto-research on any project\n\nthanks to the open source community for giving suggestions and PRs - look forward to making it better together!",
      "media": [],
      "quote": {
        "id": "2039458683831415271",
        "url": "https://x.com/kunchenguid/status/2039458683831415271",
        "author": {
