      "reposted_by": null,
      "created_at": "2026-04-27T23:15:24.000Z",
      "sort_at": "2026-04-27T23:15:24.000Z",
      "text": "this is where I actually want some “Apple Intelligence” - \n\non-device SLM that learns which notifications i don’t care about and punishes apps that send them",
      "media": [],
      "quote": {
        "id": "2048882067757310215",
        "url": "https://x.com/GergelyOrosz/status/2048882067757310215",
        "author": {
          "screen_name": "GergelyOrosz",
          "name": "Gergely Orosz",
          "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/673095429748350976/ei5eeouV_200x200.png"
        },
        "created_at": "2026-04-27T21:48:45.000Z",
        "text": "And killed notifications from Spotify as well.\n\nCannot believe how there is practically no company by now that has not abused push notifications for product marketing.\n\nI’ve now been trained to disallow notifications from any and all apps - save for my main banking+messaging one",
        "media": [
          {
            "id": "2048882058726957056",
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HG8XYIEXYAAl3ZV.jpg?name=orig",
