      "sort_at": "2026-04-27T18:37:05.000Z",
      "text": "i just chatted with @ALEngineered on his podcast for 3 hrs straight and we couldn’t stop - it’s genuinely the more knowledge-packed conversation i’ve had for a long time. and it just went live here!\nhttps://youtu.be/q3ca41YIZjc\n\nwe covered my origin story, pivotal points in my career, IC and management, working solo, and some must-know about AI’s impact on SWE and where things are heading. hope it’ll be helpful for anyone that are feeling unsure about the future!",
      "media": [],
      "quote": null,
      "reply_to_id": null,
      "thread_root_id": "2048833830682079411",
      "is_note_tweet": true,
      "lang": "en",
