      "created_at": "2026-04-27T03:24:26.000Z",
      "sort_at": "2026-04-27T03:24:26.000Z",
      "text": "opus 4.7 spent over an hour debugging a tricky CI pipeline issue\n\nwhen it's done, I could see its excitement through the all-caps \"WE FIXED IT\"\n\nthese little emotions is something i still don't quite see from gpt",
